WEBVTT

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:14.280
This place… I thought so… A Cute Café!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.530
We just opened recently.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:22.330
Ahh… We saw to it that he got home safely.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.660
Eh really? I’m glad.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.000
Momomiya Ichigo-san…

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:27.660
Hmm?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.460
Welcome to Café Mew Mew,
as well as…

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.090
Our secret hideout.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.520
Waaaa… what a beautiful store.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:52.230
Now, could you change into this?
The locker room is over there.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.070
Eh. What? Why do I have to change?

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.780
Just hurry up and do it.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.240
Hey!

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:04.210
Won’t you try it on please?
It’s something for a special lady.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.290
Okay.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:13.040
It’s begun, isn’t it? …Mew Project.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:13.760
Yes.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:17.220
Professor Shirogane should be happy.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.720
If only he was alive,
I wish I could show this to him.

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.260
Yes.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:27.600
Wuahhh~! What is this?
It’s cute… cute!!! so cute!!!

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.390
Fabulous! Looks good!

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.890
R-Really?

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:37.030
Yeah! The best, great design… the costume that is.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.110
What do you mean?!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:41.900
Now, now, we’re going to be together for a long time.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.000
Please try to get along.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.450
“Together for a long time”?

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:46.490
What do you mean by that?

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:50.290
Also, what was the meaning of leaving me to fight those monsters?!

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:54.580
The one you fought wasn’t a monster…
Chimera Anima.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.340
C-Chimera Anima…?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.590
We are talking about aliens who possess animals and turn them into savages.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:04.680
Huh..? Aliens?

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:11.180
We don’t know what their purpose is, but the fact is, humans are approaching a crisis.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.480
Just who are you guys anyway?

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.190
Just rich high school students…

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.320
…And owners of this place.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:23.490
To be honest, we are trying to guard against these aliens,

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:29.210
…our means of doing so is with Red Data Animals.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:30.670
Ah…

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:34.290
You’re familiar with it, aren’t you?
You went to see it with that guy right?

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:36.130
How did you know about that?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:40.380
W-Waaaa… you were spying on people’s date!!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.720
The DNA of Red Data Animals have a strong power to protect their species,

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.790
when these animals encounter a Chimera Anima,

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:55.650
their DNA enables them to withstand the attacks of the parasitic alien.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:03:01.570
That’s why we are searching for people who can host the DNA of Red Data Animals.

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.530
And… that’s me?

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.650
You’re qualified.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:11.240
That’s why you were able to transform into Mew Strawberry and use cat-like powers,

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:15.050
…and turn that Chimera Anima back into a mouse.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:19.090
B-But… but… that means I’m going to be a cat!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:24.550
That can’t be helped. It comes with being able to use the Red Data Animal’s power.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.330
You’re kidding me! Because of that, weird things have been happening to me:

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.850
I fell and landed safely on my feet, feel
sleepy all the time, and can predict weather.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.190
It’s a PROBLEM!!

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.610
It’s a wonderful thing,
Momomiya Ichigo-san.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:43.610
It is very rare to be chosen,
to be the Top Lady.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.160
Top… Lady?

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:52.120
If you think about it, guys will be falling at your feet…

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.840
You could end up being an idol.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:03:59.920
…Really?

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.050
Yup.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.890
So please, leave your dreams
in our hands.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.610
Well, that’s how it’s going to be.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:18.490
Just do your best, friend of justice.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.020
What?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.320
How come it’s just only me?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.610
It’s not just you.
You have 4 companions.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.740
Companions?

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.200
They have markings somewhere on their body. That will let you know.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.440
If you need help… Find them!

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:33.080
Ehh!??

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.590
Wait, does it mean I also have it?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.880
Aahh since when!? I wasn’t aware!

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:40.750
Hold on!!

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:41.830
Stop screaming!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.340
Once the mission is completed,
it’ll disappear.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.170
But but until that time it will be there? That is so cruel!

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.720
My apologies…

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.270
Cute!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:00.350
This is R2000. Please accept him.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:04.450
He has an alien sensor in him.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:07.950
Nice to meet you, nice to meet you.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.740
Nice to meet you.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.250
Eh… it got smaller.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.870
Also…

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.080
There’s more?!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:19.500
You’ll have to work as a waitress here.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.540
What?! Is that why I look like this?

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:24.920
Doesn’t it look good on you?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:30.340
The store is only a cover for us, and we won’t get that many customers anyway.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.100
Furthermore,

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.390
you would be able to eat as much of the store’s cake and sweets as you like.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.390
You’re kidding!!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.600
Really!!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:42.490
As much cake as I want!
But I’ll get fat!

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:45.150
That’s not what we’re supposed to be discussing!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:56.450
This blue planet shall be mine.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.410
Yes.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:01.590
Do whatever’s necessary to get it.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.470
Please leave it to me.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:13.090
What am I going to do?
This is getting serious.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:15.350
Ichigo, something’s coming, something’s coming.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.680
Huh? Where?

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.940
What’s coming?

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.690
Could it be… a Chimera Anima?

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.780
I don’t know but it’s coming.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:37.870
That tickles. Stop, that’s very ticklish!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:41.170
Hey! Miki! Come back here.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.870
Please excuse him.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:48.680
Hey, you can’t go running off like that.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.720
Miki, you ran off again?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.470
Could you please forgive him?

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:01.020
It’s okay.

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:04.480
Here, you can wipe your face with this.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.040
Um, thanks…

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.610
This handkerchief feels pretty soft.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.650
It’s silk.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:17.370
Don’t you know what silk is?
You can have it if you’d like.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.370
Well then, excuse us for now.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.290
Arghh… what was that!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.210
Sorry, it was a mistake, sorry.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.720
Good morning.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.680
Good morning!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.560
What? Umm, what are you doing?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:47.440
Do you guys have any new strange marks that appeared recently?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.600
Huh?

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.700
I didn’t think so…
No no, it’s nothing…!

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.280
Momomiya-san.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.320
Aoyama-kun!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.700
Wait…

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:00.990
Good morning.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.820
I’m glad there’s nothing wrong with him.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:12.920
I was worried because you acted strangely yesterday, but you seem fine now.

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.220
That was just…

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:17.930
He has?!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.980
…a bruise?

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.020
What is it?

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.270
It’s just that bruise…

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.230
Oh this… it’s from Kendo practice.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.730
Oh yeah? Well, that’s that.

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.230
Is something wrong this morning?

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.820
Oh it’s nothing.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.370
I dropped it.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:38.870
I’ll help you.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.910
Could it be? He got that bruise yesterday?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.090
I’m sorry, for being so much trouble…

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.590
Aoyama-kun, I love you very much.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.390
I’m sorry.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.310
He held my hand!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.320
You’re kidding!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.950
NO WAYY?!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.620
Wahh~ Look! An alien!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.250
Eh?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:28.660
No way!?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:29.420
Momomiya-san?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.790
…No problem here.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.890
My eyes must be deceiving me!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:39.510
I have to go, so see you again, bye!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.400
Oh yeah, so it actually popped out?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.520
I didn’t know that!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.140
Yeah, I didn’t tell you.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.020
Aw, come off it!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.110
Besides, I can’t find my “companions” at all!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:57.030
I’ll NEVER want to fight alone!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:01.400
Ichigo-san.

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.530
Uh, yes.

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.250
The Apple Tart and Pear Charlotte are ready now.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.280
It’s so PRETTY!

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.580
Sorry for the trouble.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.090
Huh… oh yeah.

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.850
Must you be so tough on her?

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.100
Umm, excuse me?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.510
Should I still wait for my
Green Tea Cake?

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:28.270
Excuse me, but the tea I ordered was Earl Gray, not Darjeeling.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.890
Argh and they said this place was just a cover!? But look how packed it gets!

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:34.490
Nooooo!!!!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.550
Ahhh I’m so tired.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:01.760
Oh yeah, I haven’t given you a name yet.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.430
What should it be? Hrmm…

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:08.350
I know, since I like Aoyama-kun, how about Masha?

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:09.810
(Note: She’s naming it after Aoyama as his full name is Aoyama Masaya)

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.810
Masha! Masha!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.310
Do you like it?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.070
Like it, like it!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:18.320
I think… just saying his name makes me happy.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.950
Umm, what’s wrong?

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.110
It’s there, it’s there, Chimera Anima!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.540
That girl from yesterday?

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.580
Wait Masha, there’s nothing there.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.040
It’s there, it’s there!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.510
It’s leaving, it’s leaving now.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.420
It couldn’t be…

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.830
You came all this way to return the handkerchief?

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:52.350
But I thought the young miss presented it to you as a gift…

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.810
Yes but it’s too much of a gift.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.850
Woahh, so cool.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.360
Now, please come in.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:07.410
Hmm, a guest?

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:12.920
Thanks for the handkerchief yesterday, that’s why I came…

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.960
You’re the girl from before?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.300
It’s just Miki right? Good evening.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.340
I’ll get you some tea.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.850
Is that the only reason you’re here?

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:29.390
Ummm… I’m Momomiya Ichigo.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.100
Aizawa-san?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.060
You can call me Minto.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.310
Well… Minto…

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.360
This is a really cool house you live in.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:46.650
What’s wrong, Masha? I thought you said there’s something here? This is weird…

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.910
What are you doing?

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:55.000
Nothing. It’s just that, this house is so big and amazing…

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.620
How is it, Masha?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:57.420
Nothing detected.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.630
Hold on… Stop that now!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.920
Wuah!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:05.510
Coming into people’s houses and running about here and there.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:08.140
You should excuse yourself and leave.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:10.830
I’m sorry.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:14.560
Miki, you shouldn’t go near
that vulgar girl.

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:16.980
V-Vulgar?!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.110
Geez… What was that!
What was that!!!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:29.160
Well sorry for coming to your house but there’s no need to react that way!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:32.910
Miki?

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.330
What is it?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.210
Oh yeah, is that so? It’s ok…

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:45.210
But if Minto sees you with me she’ll be mad again.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:48.970
Be a good boy and go home. See you!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.560
I’ll come play with you again. Bye bye!

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:18.620
Miki! You went out again didn’t you!?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.880
What’s wrong?
What’s with that scary face?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.760
Let’s go home, Masha.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.600
Chimera Anima, Chimera Anima!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.470
Eh? But you didn’t detect anything
all this while…

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:40.070
Incomplete! Incomplete!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.530
Let’s go!!!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.700
My… my dear Miki is…

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.710
Eh… is that Miki?
But just a while ago…

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.670
Miki, what’s wrong?!

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.260
There must be something I can do…

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.510
Eh… In that case…

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:12.470
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.550
You there, alien! Release Miki now!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:01.980
Or else… For the future of the Earth, at your service nya!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.650
Wait… what’s…

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.070
I’m sorry for the surprise, I’ll explain it later.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.080
StrawberBell!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:18.620
Stop it!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.000
Don’t hurt him.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.680
What’s wrong Miki? Please stop it!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.020
Minto…

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:47.190
That mark… Could it be?

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.530
You’re… you’re one of our companions.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.240
What are you talking about?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.540
You may not believe it, but you can transform too!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.830
Please… transform!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.460
That’s not possible.
How am I supposed to do that?

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.300
Nooooo! Stop it!!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:22.770
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:51.750
You did it!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.710
No way!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.510
Jump, Minto!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.350
StrawberBell!

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:10.810
Now Minto, listen to your heart and call out the words.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.820
I can’t do it.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.030
You can do it! You transformed, didn’t you?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.080
Let’s go Minto.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.580
MintonArrow!!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:35.300
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.030
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.710
Retrieve! Retrieve!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:16.880
Miki… I’m so glad you’re back.

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.680
It’s wonderful.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.720
It looks so good on you.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:34.390
So I’ll leave finding the other three to you then.

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:37.780
Well, I need to get ready
to open the store.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.030
What is it?

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:44.990
Thank you…

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.030
Eh?

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.950
…for saving Miki.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.620
She really is a nice girl after all.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.170
We helped each other because we’re friends.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:59.180
Let’s do our best together from now.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.900
Don’t mix different issues together.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:11.560
I don’t have the intention of cooperating with someone so vulgar.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.060
V-VULGAR?!!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:21.070
Geee… Can’t we just get along?! Nya!

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:29.020
Rumor has it that a young girl’s spirit appears every night at that school,

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:30.680
causing spooky accidents.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:31.770
Eeeeeehhhhh?!?!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.980
A weird sound is coming from nowhere…

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.600
Arrggghh I HATE GHOSTS!!!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:39.480
I’ll never get bored with you around.

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:40.650
So it was a lie?

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.320
It’s your fault for being gullible.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:45.110
Ah, behind you, Ichigo.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.070
DON’T SCAREE ME ANNYY MOREE!

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:50.950
Next: “The Ghost Story in the School:
Finding the true identity of the ghost nya~!”

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.670
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
